<title>UK: Chase Manhattan hires regional M&amp;A head.</title>
<headline>Chase Manhattan hires regional M&amp;A head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Manhattan Corp said on Monday it has hired Jim Downing as a managing director and head of mergers and acquisitions for Europe, Africa and the Middle East.</p>
<p>Downing joins, 43, Chase from Lehman Brothers where he was a managing director and co-head of the firm's European corporate finance group.</p>
<p>London-based Downing will report to Mark Davis, managing director and head of global M&amp;A.</p>
<p>Downing has previously worked for Wasserstein, Perella; and Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864.</p>
